    "layoutFixtures": "Both original approach/terminal DOM fixtures and the eight final-font fixtures inject copies of genuine model-generated states via a response-only PureModel.create override. Final fixtures choose the corresponding runtime menu level. These isolate layout/readability; they are not browser-earned complete flights.",
    "privateGuardAndClock": "For each original source frame, throwing getters on all underscore fields remain unread, and changed external render-time/raw-input arguments produce identical draw commands, HUD and result. The model snapshot is recursively frozen and unchanged.",
    "atlasEnvelope": "The actual original atlas alpha texels are evaluated with full bilinear support and the renderer half-texel UV inset. Maximum radius is5.987528734709431m, below6m. The exact font-only reverse proof confirms final painter/projection/geometry bytes are unchanged.",
    "finalFontProof": "Each of eight exact before/after replacements occurs once. Reversing them on the final production game recreates the original game bytes and SHA. Other recorded sources remain identical. The final targeted page measures PureRenderer.measureText widths, text panel bounds, two complete display sizes, sidebar and short result titles.",
